WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Music]

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
At Sypher, every project starts with a question:

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
what should people feel, and what should they do next?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
We have built identities for law firms and coffee roasters,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
launched e-commerce stores, and filmed brand stories in the mountains.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Whatever the medium, we measure success the same way:

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
by results our clients can see.
